;
; How Joinery files one step of its undo history in MYRA (joinery_rules.h
; JR6): the step (its place in the history, 1..1024), the byte offset the
; edit was made at, how many bytes it removed and how many it inserted
; (each 0..16777216, a file of at most 16 MiB). The rules say what the
; values may mean; this says whether they make a record.
^ZXJOINERY(step:i4) = offset:i8! ^ removed:i8! ^ inserted:i8!
